        },
        "publishTime": "2026-06-30T13:09:27.210946233Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wSFJVOUllbFF3WmpCNlZEVnplSEl3ZG5VMFpWRRAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wSFJVOUllbFF3WmpCNlZEVnplSEl3ZG5VMFpWRRAB!2m1!1s0x340400b4c87a5dad:0x7f0ff0f8aa491b83"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJrV16yLQABDQRgxtJqvjwD38/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poQ04wZEJiemx1VVVWU04yWTFXVmxWZFhkcFQyYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "10 個月前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "It’s great to come back for these special beef or pig liver noodles. The soup is very tasty but not overly salty. The beef isn’t top-tier premium quality—it’s the typical local fresh beef, which is still very good. The French toast with kaya (Singaporean-style) isn’t appealing at all. The milk tea is exceptionally good. One order of beef (without rice noodles), two bowls of beef and pig liver noodles, plus French toast and one iced milk tea, came to HKD 157—which is a very reasonable price.\n\n很開心再來吃這家獨特的牛肉或豬膶河粉。湯底非常美味，但不會太鹹。牛肉不是頂級的，而是典型的本地新鮮牛肉，已經很好吃了。加了咖椰（新加坡風味）的西多士完全不吸引人。奶茶則是特別出色。一份牛肉（不加河粉）、兩碗牛肉豬膶河、加上西多士和一杯凍奶茶，總共HKD157，價格非常合理。",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "It’s great to come back for these special beef or pig liver noodles. The soup is very tasty but not overly salty. The beef isn’t top-tier premium quality—it’s the typical local fresh beef, which is still very good. The French toast with kaya (Singaporean-style) isn’t appealing at all. The milk tea is exceptionally good. One order of beef (without rice noodles), two bowls of beef and pig liver noodles, plus French toast and one iced milk tea, came to HKD 157—which is a very reasonable price.\n\n很開心再來吃這家獨特的牛肉或豬膶河粉。湯底非常美味，但不會太鹹。牛肉不是頂級的，而是典型的本地新鮮牛肉，已經很好吃了。加了咖椰（新加坡風味）的西多士完全不吸引人。奶茶則是特別出色。一份牛肉（不加河粉）、兩碗牛肉豬膶河、加上西多士和一杯凍奶茶，總共HKD157，價格非常合理。",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
